# LF everywhere — in the repository and in every working tree, whatever the OS. Without this,
# core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) checks text out as CRLF, and `prettier --check` and
# `npm run gen-notices -- --check` then fail locally while CI on Linux passes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
